{"seq":1,"slug":"score-to-routing-weight","title":"绩效反馈到选路权重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/performance-feedback-loop/score-to-routing-weight","wordCount":2025,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"绩效反馈到选路权重\">绩效反馈到选路权重</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>绩效分数要真正改变行为，最直接的通道是选路：表现好的承运商获得更高的选路优先级与更大的货量份额。这条通道的优势在于它不依赖合同谈判——路由系统是我的，权重一改，货量结构立刻变化。</p>\n<p>但&quot;按分数排名分配货量&quot;这个朴素做法在实践中会失败，原因是它忽略了三个约束。<strong>容量约束</strong>：分数最高的承运商运力有限，把所有货压过去会超载。<strong>成本约束</strong>：分数高不等于价格合适，全押一家会失去议价能力。<strong>探索约束</strong>：表现稍差的承运商如果分不到货量，就永远没有机会证明自己已经改进，形成马太效应——这正是<a href=\"../scorecard-grading/carrier-tier-dynamic-share\">分级与份额动态调整</a>中&quot;保底货量&quot;要解决的问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[记分卡分数] --&gt; B[分数 -&gt; 效用值&lt;br/&gt;单调映射]&#10;  B --&gt; C[权重基础值&lt;br/&gt;softmax 或线性]&#10;  C --&gt; D[容量约束]&#10;  C --&gt; E[成本调整]&#10;  C --&gt; F[探索配额]&#10;  D --&gt; G[分配求解&lt;br/&gt;线性规划]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[线路级权重下发]&#10;  H --&gt; I[路由系统执行]&#10;  I --&gt; J[产出绩效数据]&#10;  J --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[记分卡分数] --&gt; B[分数 -&gt; 效用值&lt;br/&gt;单调映射]\n  B --&gt; C[权重基础值&lt;br/&gt;softmax 或线性]\n  C --&gt; D[容量约束]\n  C --&gt; E[成本调整]\n  C --&gt; F[探索配额]\n  D --&gt; G[分配求解&lt;br/&gt;线性规划]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[线路级权重下发]\n  H --&gt; I[路由系统执行]\n  I --&gt; J[产出绩效数据]\n  J --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"从分数到权重-三种映射\">从分数到权重：三种映射</h2><h3 id=\"线性映射\">线性映射</h3><p>最简单的方式是让权重与分数成正比：<code>$w_i \\propto \\max(0, s_i - s_{\\min})$</code>。它可解释性好（分数高 10% 就多拿 10% 权重），缺点是区分度低——当所有承运商分数都在 70–85 之间时，权重差异只有 20%，不足以产生有效的激励。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指数映射-softmax\">指数映射（softmax）</h3><p>把分数作为效用值指数化再归一，得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = \\frac{\\exp(\\beta s_i)}{\\sum_j \\exp(\\beta s_j)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5488em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>$\\beta$</code> 控制区分度：<code>$\\beta \\to 0$</code> 时退化为均分，<code>$\\beta$</code> 越大则高分承运商获得越集中的份额。这个形式与离散选择模型中的多项 logit 概率表达式同构——效用 <code>$U_{ni} = \\beta z_{ni} + \\varepsilon_{ni}$</code> 下选择概率为 <code>$P_{ni} = \\exp(\\beta z_{ni}) / \\sum_j \\exp(\\beta z_{nj})$</code>，误差项服从独立同分布的极值分布（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Discrete_choice\">离散选择模型</a>）。</p>\n<p>这个同构关系不只带来形式上的优雅，它还把选路权重接进了一套成熟的建模语言：如果希望加入成本、时效承诺等<strong>备选项属性</strong>（而不只是承运商的整体分数），可以直接扩展为带属性项的 logit，用历史选择数据估计系数。代价是 logit 的独立不相关备选项（IIA）性质——两个很相似的承运商会互相&quot;稀释&quot;概率，而它们的替代关系未必对称。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分段映射-等级制\">分段映射（等级制）</h3><p>第三种方式是直接按等级映射权重（A 级得 <code>$w_A$</code>、B 级得 <code>$w_B$</code>……）。它的优点是稳定、可解释、不随分数的小幅波动改变货量结构；缺点是激励是阶梯式的，接近等级边界时改进压力最大，远离边界时几乎没有边际激励。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>映射方式</th>\n<th>区分度</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n<th>可解释性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>承运商少、分数区间窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>softmax</td>\n<td>高（可调）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>承运商多、需要强激励</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分段（等级制）</td>\n<td>阶梯</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>合同与服务费已按等级挂钩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中常用的是<strong>组合</strong>：段内线性、段间阶梯。这样既有等级带来的稳定性，也有段内的边际激励。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量约束下的分配\">容量约束下的分配</h2><p>权重算出来之后不能直接下发，因为权重是<strong>目标份额</strong>，而承运商有运力上限。把&quot;给定各承运商的目标权重与容量上限，如何在线路间分配货量使成本最小&quot;形式化，得到的正是运输问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>c</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mi>j</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum*{i=1}^{m}\\sum*{j=1}^{n} c*{ij}x*{ij} \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum*{j} x*{ij} \\le s*i,\\; \\sum*{i} x*{ij} = d_j,\\; x*{ij} \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>$s_i$</code> 是承运商 <code>$i$</code> 的容量上限，<code>$d_j$</code> 是线路 <code>$j$</code> 的货量需求，<code>$c_{ij}$</code> 是单位成本；总容量通常大于总需求，因此容量约束取不等式（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transportation_theory_(mathematics)\">运输问题</a>）。这个形式把&quot;绩效权重&quot;翻译成了成本函数的一部分：分数高的承运商被赋予<strong>更低的影子成本</strong>，从而在最优解里自然地拿到更多货量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from scipy.optimize import linprog&#10;&#10;def route_allocate(score, cost, capacity, demand, gamma=0.35, floor_share=0.05):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;score 越高越优先；cost 为基准单位成本。&#10;       用 score 折减成本，使高效承运商获得更多货量。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    m, n = cost.shape&#10;    # 分数折减：score 归一化到 [0,1] 后作为成本折扣系数&#10;    sn = (score - score.min()) / max(score.ptp(), 1e-9)&#10;    adj = cost * (1.0 - gamma * sn[:, None])&#10;    c = adj.reshape(-1)&#10;&#10;    A_ub, b_ub = [], []&#10;    for i in range(m):                                  # 容量上限&#10;        row = np.zeros(m * n); row[i * n:(i + 1) * n] = 1&#10;        A_ub.append(row); b_ub.append(capacity[i])&#10;    for j in range(n):                                  # 需求下限（保底货量）&#10;        row = np.zeros(m * n); row[j::n] = 1&#10;        A_ub.append(-row); b_ub.append(-demand[j] * floor_share)&#10;&#10;    A_eq = [np.eye(n).repeat(1, axis=0)]                # 需求等式&#10;    A_eq = []&#10;    for j in range(n):&#10;        row = np.zeros(m * n); row[j::n] = 1&#10;        A_eq.append(row)&#10;    res = linprog(c, A_ub=np.array(A_ub), b_ub=np.array(b_ub),&#10;                  A_eq=np.array(A_eq), b_eq=demand, bounds=(0, None),&#10;                  method=&quot;highs&quot;)&#10;    return res.x.reshape(m, n), res.status\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;